{"title":"Markets in everything, bet on tariff repeal edition","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/922052183/0/marginalrevolution~Markets-in-everything-bet-on-tariff-repeal-edition.html","date":1753245129000,"content":"<blockquote>\r\n<p><b>Cantor Fitzgerald, a financial services company led by the sons of US Commerce Secretary Howard Lutnick, has offered to buy the right to hundreds of millions of dollars in potential refunds from companies that have paid Trump’s tariffs.</b></p>\r\n<p>The offer means that the<a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/typesfast/status/1947375727298678930\" target=\"_blank\"> sons</a> of the pro-tariff commerce secretary, Kyle and Brandon, have made a way for investors to bet that President Donald Trump’s signature tariffs will be struck down in court.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.msn.com/en-us/money/economy/cantor-fitzgerald-offers-to-buy-the-rights-in-potential-refunds-from-companies-that-have-paid-trump-s-tariffs/ar-AA1J1A4I\" target=\"_blank\">the full story</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/07/markets-in-everything-bet-on-tariff-repeal-edition.html\">Markets in everything, bet on tariff repeal edition</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/922052183/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/922052183/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/922052183/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.c